{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S08、S11、S12 等短停留段安排了较多交替出现的文字，观众容易来不及扫完，注意力被屏幕牵走；这一点不如 X 的左右并列结构直观。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用【】突出每段叙事的关键转折，让人更容易抓住人物当下的处境，也更清楚他为什么会反复动摇。它尤其把舍不得过去的亲近、害怕未来的孤单和不愿重新忍受委屈区分开来，使前后心理变化成为一条连贯的线；感受文字又能结合音乐的力度、音色、节奏和情绪转折，具体呈现细微变化。X 的左右并列更方便快速扫读，但感受词与人物叙事之间的对应关系较弱，整体的心理解释力和音乐表现的细腻度不及 Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7c5bc367-65b9-4f41-b14f-073be3076b6e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T232505305243Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:25:48.037239+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f60059e88757ea8f14fb2a428f32ac19df8694cae0d871f965b2cd38661c28f0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f